ntainer: user-service\n  Normal   Started    77s               kubelet            spec.containers{user-service}: Started container user-service\n  Warning  Unhealthy  0s (x7 over 60s)  kubelet            spec.containers{user-service}: Readiness probe failed: Get "http://10.244.0.120:8080/healthz": dial tcp 10.244.0.120:8080: connect: connection refused\n', id='d4b87485-f3a0-45b6-98aa-470df083afc6', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-8485a27d0a459ea1'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='74679302-9fcf-4539-b72a-a07ac744800c')]]
